                    <h2 class="section-heading">
                        <i data-lucide="file-check" size="20"></i>
                        1. Acceptance of Terms
                    </h2>
                    <p class="policy-text">
                        By accessing, browsing, or purchasing through PVTT, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you are prohibited from accessing this platform.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <!-- Section 2 -->
                <section id="drops" class="card-machined policy-card">
                    <h2 class="section-heading">
                        <i data-lucide="package-check" size="20"></i>
                        2. Limited Drops & Stock Allocation
                    </h2>
                    <p class="policy-text">
                        All garments, footwear, and accessories are produced in finite quantities for scheduled drop events. Adding an item to your cart does not reserve the inventory. Stock is allocated strictly upon successful payment authorization at checkout.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="policy-list">
                        <li class="policy-list-item">
                            <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" size="18"></i>
                            <span>All sales during scheduled drop releases are final unless otherwise stated.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="policy-list-item">
                            <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" size="18"></i>
                            <span>Purchase limits per customer or per household may apply to specific high-demand releases.</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <!-- Section 3 -->
                <section id="orders" class="card-machined policy-card">
                    <h2 class="section-heading">
                        <i data-lucide="credit-card" size="20"></i>
                        3. Order Verification & Pricing
                    </h2>
                    <p class="policy-text">
                        We reserve the right to refuse, limit, or cancel any order placed with us. Prices for our products are subject to change without notice. In the event an item is listed at an incorrect price due to a system glitch, we reserve the right to cancel any orders placed for that item.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <!-- Section 4 -->
                <section id="bots" class="card-machined policy-card">
                    <h2 class="section-heading">
                        <i data-lucide="shield-alert" size="20"></i>
                        4. Anti-Bot & Fair Access Policy
                    </h2>
                    <p class="policy-text">
                        To maintain fair access for our community, the use of automated purchasing tools, scripts, or bots is strictly prohibited. Orders identified as being placed using unauthorized software will be immediately canceled without prior notice, and offending IP addresses or accounts will be permanently blocked.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <!-- Section 5 -->
                <section id="returns" class="card-machined policy-card">
                    <h2 class="section-heading">
                        <i data-lucide="refresh-cw" size="20"></i>
                        5. Returns, Refunds & Exchanges
                    </h2>
                    <p class="policy-text">
                        Due to the limited nature of our drops, exchanges for different sizes are subject to remaining stock availability. If a replacement size is unavailable, store credit or a full refund will be issued once returned items pass physical inspection.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="policy-list">
                        <li class="policy-list-item">
                            <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" size="18"></i>
                            <span>Items must be returned unworn, unwashed, and in original packaging with tags intact within 14 days of delivery.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="policy-list-item">
                            <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" size="18"></i>
                            <span>Return shipping fees are the responsibility of the customer unless the product arrived damaged or defective.</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
